# Upstream reference strings, extracted from a local DSH install.
#
# Kept out of the repository so it does not redistribute upstream's texts.
# Regenerate them on your own machine:
#
#   npm run scan                              # resolve installed bundles
#   node tools/dump-reference.mjs --bilingual  # tools/en/ and tools/ref/
tools/en/
tools/ref/

# Machine-specific absolute bundle paths, written by tools/scan-install.mjs.
tools/bundles.json

# Latest audit result, useful locally but not a shared artifact.
baseline/last-audit.json

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
